### Slide 5: The Terminal
## THE CONTROL CENTER

The **Terminal** is where all commands are executed.

**[VISUAL: Extreme closeup of a futuristic wrist-mounted holographic computer with a blinking green cursor on a black screen, Matrix-style code rain in background --style cinematic sci-fi --ar 16:9]**

Think of it as the **cockpit controls** for your code.

